: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 110, 81); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">天才小魔女，好奇心旺盛喜欢自说自话，是缺乏一般社会常识的话痨小可爱，热衷于晶石研究。 </span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" data-filtered=\"filtered\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 110, 81); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">幼年在人体晶石实验中度过，也因此心智和外观都远低于实际年龄，某次事故中逃离后开始流浪生涯，因为对晶石研究的强大天赋和兴趣成为魔女被法皇国通缉。非常中意铃兰小镇，自说自话地住下来开了个晶石工坊继续她的晶石研究。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" data-filtered=\"filtered\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(124, 110, 81); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">贝拉对这个世界的奥秘充满了好奇。</span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<br>\n[[File:官方消息113.jpg|link=]]\n<center><small>*图片内容仅供参考，实际效果以游戏内为准</small></center>\n<br>\n[[File:官方消息104.gif|link=]]\n<br><br>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:37:01.283212+00:00"}